---
// src/components/TheManifesto.astro
---
<section id="the-manifesto" class="manifesto-section">
  <div class="manifesto-container">
    
    <div class="manifesto-header" data-reveal>
      <span class="manifesto-tag">The Philosophy</span>
      <h2 class="manifesto-title">An Uncompromised Truth</h2>
      <div class="manifesto-continuous-text">
        <p class="manifesto-lead">
          You are standing at the final inch of a very long journey. Every harvest is the living heritage of indigenous communities who steward the land with dignity and ecological mastery.
        </p>
        <p class="manifesto-body">
          Across all origins, harvesters walk into the forest and take only what is ripe. What the wild animals claim or what the season hasn't finished is left with joy. They carry back only what nature agreed to give.
        </p>
        <p class="manifesto-body">
          An origin is not a line drawn on a map—it is the elevation, the rainfall, the soil, and the living wisdom of its people. Every yield remains untouched, unblended, and faithful to its native ground.
        </p>
        <p class="manifesto-body">
          A harvester's ethical decision has value only when a market honors it. When you choose a yield, you complete that decision. You are not downstream from the origin; you are inside it.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .manifesto-section {
    position: relative;
    background-color: var(--color-forest-deep);
    color: var(--color-warm-cream);
    padding: clamp(5rem, 12vh, 9rem) clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 6rem);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(245, 237, 216, 0.08);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(245, 237, 216, 0.08);
  }

  .manifesto-container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: clamp(3rem, 7vh, 5rem);
  }

  .manifesto-header {
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .manifesto-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.25em;
    color: var(--color-gold);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  .manifesto-title {
    font-family: var(--font-institutional);
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 4.2rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;
    color: var(--color-warm-cream);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .manifesto-lead {
    font-family: var(--font-narrative);
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.2vw, 1.7rem);
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-gold);
    margin: 0;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .manifesto-continuous-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    max-width: 750px;
  }

  .manifesto-body {
    font-family: var(--font-narrative);
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 1.8vw, 1.5rem);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: rgba(245, 237, 216, 0.85);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Mobile responsiveness */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .manifesto-continuous-text {
      gap: 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
